    "title": "What’s open on Good Friday 2026? Banks, mail, UPS and FedEx hours",
    "text": "April 2, 2026, 11:06 a.m. ETGood Friday is Friday, April 3, this year. The day commemorates the crucifixion and death of Jesus Christ. From the early days of Christianity, it has been observed as a day of sorrow, penance and fasting, according to Britannica.Here’s what to know about bank, mail and shipping services on Good Friday in 2026.Is the post office open on Good Friday?U.S. Postal Service locations will operate as normal on Friday, April 3. Post offices will be open, and mail delivery will continue as usual.Are banks open on Good Friday?Most bank branches will be open since Good Friday is not a federal holiday. However, hours may vary by location, so it’s best to check with your local branch.Is UPS open on Good Friday?UPS pickup and delivery services will run as usual, and UPS Store locations will be open.Is FedEx open on Good Friday?FedEx pickup and delivery services will also operate normally, and FedEx Office locations will be open.What is Easter?Easter is one of the most important holidays in Christianity, celebrating the resurrection of Jesus Christ. It marks the culmination of Holy Week, which includes Palm Sunday, Holy Thursday and Good Friday.Why does Easter change every year?Easter does not have a fixed date. In Western Christianity, it is celebrated on the first Sunday after the first full moon following the spring equinox (March 21). Because of this, Easter can fall anywhere between March 22 and April 25. Eastern Orthodox churches calculate the date using the Julian calendar, which is why their Easter is often observed later.Key Easter-related dates in 2026Key Easter-related dates in 2026Palm Sunday: March 29Holy Thursday: April 2Good Friday: April 3Easter Sunday: April 5What stores are closed on Easter Sunday?Many major retailers will be closed on Sunday, April 5, including:TargetCostcoSam’s ClubLowe’sTJ Maxx, Marshalls and HomeGoodsMacy’sAldiAppleNordstrom and Nordstrom RackJCPenneyKohl’sBurlingtonOffice Depot and OfficeMaxMichaelsHobby LobbyDick’s Sporting GoodsWhat stores are open on Easter Sunday?Some stores will remain open, though hours may vary:Walmart — regular hoursWegmans — regular hours (some departments may vary)Home Depot — 8 a.m. to 6 p.m.CVS Pharmacy — hours vary by locationIKEA — 11 a.m. to 6 p.m.Tractor Supply Co. — 9 a.m. to 6 p.m.",
